{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3efe3c80dc5367ec350079f5df4d235be5422ad343cf620d37ee3304c6312b2e", "ja": "（仕事先から帰る途中、未来が急に立ち止まった。\n何かを見ているけど……）", "zh": "（回工作地点的路上，未来突然停了下来。她好像在看什么……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "73b41f72449a1294ac672dacd726194b30295330dcbecaac6c34872964e6415c", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nあそこのお店にある機械、似てませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n那家店里的那台机器，是不是有点眼熟呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "85dea24c9e5e87fa93a7a0e9a3d9553061c8d4156a18ea4c19912d0b233af6b0", "ja": "バレンタインのイベントでチョコ作りをした時、\nスタジオにあった、あの大きな機械です！", "zh": "情人节活动做巧克力时，摄影棚里那台大机器！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6595c926d9e34e154c7c690a4bf61a1c5af2087739777624a4b0123fa5089769", "ja": "ああ、ホイップクリームを作るマシンか。\nあれは便利だったな。", "zh": "啊，是制作鲜奶油的机器啊。\n那可真方便。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "85ab9f89341e0e68d8a7985cd57110d8fad8dc9bfa6973ea378c13156d157209", "ja": "はい！　できたてのおいしい生クリームがたくさん\n出てくるなんて、夢みたいな機械だったな～♪", "zh": "是的！能产出大量刚做好的美味鲜奶油，真是像做梦一样的机器呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6408f736d08a1c53e51d51ce80e6ef76af284434cc126c71162eb0a985917ea8", "ja": "あの時の未来、たくさん\nクリームを使ってたもんな……。", "zh": "那时未来你确实用了好多\n奶油啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "bd67784f182f9765f1c1900d569c1dca45139b522c70128a262d3e8074207ceb", "ja": "だってボタンを押したら、好きなだけクリームが\n出るんですよ？　そんなの押しちゃいますよ！", "zh": "因为只要按下按钮，就会有多少奶油都能挤出来嘛？那当然会按下去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "66d82e9c6451bb5fc426657aec8f924747074ddc1fd0a0d2cb3b920f59790d03", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、好きな食べ物が\n出てくるボタンがあったら、押しますよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生要是也有能掉出喜欢吃的东西的\n按钮，您也会按的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c302a1ca173f0e2e0b4637a65f544f611b0173fad2d392389500f4a8b8b3f687", "ja": "はは、そうかもしれないな。", "zh": "哈哈，可能吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "617ee9be201c2d99396bde2a6b74f4add786bdcde67fdb4eeac6641823ba2373", "ja": "いいなー。あの機械、うちにも欲しいなー。\n一家に一台！　そう思いませんか？", "zh": "真好啊～我也好想要那台机器啊～\n每家都该配一台！您不这么觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "132532ced508bfc18318915c499548015a0120dbbcb3fde3a68c15ed3fb3ae29", "ja": "あの機械があったら、クリーム山盛りの\nお菓子、毎日作っちゃうのに♪", "zh": "要是有那台机器的话，我每天都能做出\n抹满大堆奶油的点心了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1011_p", "source_sha256": "972185c2be96d819ca1352250264f2395dd709dcea3b5962cde5dfbe59522083", "ja": "お菓子ばかりそんなに作っていたら、\nごはんが食べられなくなっちゃいそうだけどな。", "zh": "要是总做那么多点心，感觉都要没法好好吃饭了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "e884c88af1ebeeba16055870657666c3b7e4507198245564076d47fdb94e6759", "ja": "あっ、それなら大丈夫です！\n私のお母さん、お料理上手なんで♪", "zh": "啊，那就没问题了！\n我妈妈很会做饭的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "a580d353f84cdcac8b9920213363c3ea3299f6ad658b53666d16f11aab8d257e", "ja": "お菓子も作れるんですよ！　お菓子作りの本も、\nお母さんが持ってたのを借りたんです。", "zh": "我还会做点心呢！点心制作的书，也是借了妈妈的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1014_p", "source_sha256": "48603b44869a0b24021883666cc872feec33dd2eb612d18a7a097824c3087e9c", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。\n未来はクッキー作り、楽しかったか？", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。未来，做饼干开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "07c682003194d48c3f4ef9d1da7f8040a663556b390f411c5c4c79d65ab8179e", "ja": "す～っごく、楽しかったです！\nあんなに楽しいなら、また何か作ってみたいな～。", "zh": "特别特别开心！\n既然那么开心，我还想再做点什么～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "23ebb2ee2ddc03eec3543dbdc0aa8e49bae779bb9ff09e1ef51347e81f201343", "ja": "お料理も、アイドルみたいにたくさん練習したら、\n上手になれるのかな……？", "zh": "做菜也像偶像练习那样多加练习的话，就能变得拿手吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3c32e35cf12b5b5cb34a71f49920daaf5767c2c9bb7f0daea3fbbcb216259e99", "ja": "なれると思うよ。興味があるなら、\nお母さんに教わってみたらいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我觉得可以。如果你感兴趣的话，向妈妈学学不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "f7c14e74355a31f19f8d31fd9fe135636e28643d028c00b7ef5ba76463705879", "ja": "そっか～。わかりました！　えっと、\nもし、クッキーみたいに上手に作れたら……。", "zh": "这样啊～。明白了！那个，\n要是也能像做曲奇一样做得那么好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0313_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "a34715e3fe431c9c656e78d3b40354bde198b7c9738452863f620f4a63738dd4", "ja": "その時は{$P$}さん、また食べて\nくれますか？　よろしくお願いしまーす！　えへへ♪", "zh": "到时候，{$P$}先生还愿意再吃吗？拜托啦——！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
